      <mxCell id="p9c91" value="Notation: PK primary key, FK foreign key, NULL nullable column.&lt;br&gt;Lines: many side at the FK table, one side at the referenced table;&lt;br&gt;a circle on the one side means the FK is nullable (zero or one).&lt;br&gt;FKs to tables not on the page are listed as text in the column row.&lt;br&gt;Overview pages: member_id FKs to member_profile are listed as text, not drawn.&lt;br&gt;(legacy) deprecated but present; (schema only) table exists, no current code uses it." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="905" y="62" width="865" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
